Title: "Writing"
Id: "2e7be2f7-f0d2-4b68-a8dd-cc8333291495"

Text: "A nested `writing:` item in `Documented:` defines a rendering alias for the documented item.

```mlg-fragment
[LabelHeader]?
writing: <WritingAlias>
as: <WritingText>+
```

This is distinct from the top-level `Writing:` block, which maps plain names across the whole collection."
Id: "19885340-1b72-4cf2-ad7c-69ffb5ff39c1"
